# Shortcuts (new)

Purpose: curated jump-off points — hand-picked links to instances,
dashboards, or external URLs. Exists because computed widgets show
what the data says matters; shortcuts show what a human says matters
(the 5 things this team actually opens daily).

Size/position: drag + resize on the canvas (dnd), never in the menu.
Relevancy: 🔥 core · ⭐ valuable · 💤 later

| Option | Category | Relevancy | Values / default | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| variant | layout | ⭐ | list / icon grid | |
| grid columns | layout | 💤 | 2 / 3 / 4 | grid variant |
| title | display | 🔥 | text (default "Shortcuts") | |
| icon | display | 💤 | icon name / none | |
| items | data | 🔥 | [{target, label?, icon?}] ordered | target: instance / dashboard / url |
| descriptions | display | 💤 | on / off | secondary line per item |
| external badge | display | 💤 | on / off | marks url targets |
| open in | display | ⭐ | same tab / new tab | url targets |
| dead links | display | ⭐ | hide / show struck-through | deleted instance/dashboard |
| filters | filter | — | none — fully manual by design | curation IS the filter |
